Comment: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:51.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind
Comment: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:56.79,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide
Comment: 0,0:00:57.62,0:01:02.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals
